56.6929133858267775 720.0002362204724022 Td
(## ABSTRACT) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 692.2207086614173477 Td
(In modern commercial banking, the appraisal of credit applications is a critical operational task requiring both) Tj
T* (predictive accuracy and regulatory accountability. Traditional manual loan assessment procedures are labor-intensive,) Tj
T* (vulnerable to subjective cognitive biases, and incapable of scaling smoothly with expanding loan application volumes.) Tj
T* (Conversely, conventional "black-box" machine learning solutions often fail to satisfy compliance standards due to a) Tj
T* (lack of decision interpretability.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 610.0159842519684616 Td
(This project presents **LoanGuard AI**, an end-to-end AI-powered bank loan approval prediction web system) Tj
T* (developed as a final-year Bachelor of Computer Applications \(BCA\) project. The system predicts whether a prospective) Tj
T* (loan applicant is likely to be **Approved \(Class 1\)** or **Rejected \(Class 0\)** using applicant personal, employment,) Tj
T* (financial, loan, and credit history features.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 541.4175590551180903 Td
(The underlying dataset comprises **45,000 historical records** across **14 attributes**. Systematic data preprocessing) Tj
T* (identified and eliminated 10 unrealistic outliers \(imposing boundaries of applicant age $le 80$ years and employment) Tj
T* (experience $le 60$ years\), producing a verified working corpus of **44,990 records** \(34,990 Rejected and 10,000) Tj
T* (Approved\). The dataset was partitioned via an **80/20 stratified train-test split** \(35,992 training records; 8,998 test) Tj
T* (records\). Preprocessing pipelines implemented numerical standardization using `StandardScaler` across 8 continuous) Tj
T* (attributes and categorical encoding via `OneHotEncoder\(handle_unknown="ignore"\)` across 5 nominal variables.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 445.6065354330708033 Td
(Two primary machine learning classifiers were evaluated under balanced class weights: **Logistic Regression** and) Tj
T* (**Random Forest Classifier**. On the held-out test set \($N = 8,998$\), the Random Forest model demonstrated superior) Tj
T* (performance, achieving an **Accuracy of 92.58%**, **Precision of 81.74%**, **Recall of 85.75%**, **F1-Score of) Tj
T* (83.70%**, and an **Area Under the ROC Curve \(ROC-AUC\) of 0.9742**, significantly outperforming Logistic) Tj
T* (Regression \(85.17% accuracy\).) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 363.4018110236219741 Td
(To resolve the black-box opacity problem, the project integrates Explainable Artificial Intelligence \(XAI\) using) Tj
T* (**SHAP \(SHapley Additive exPlanations\)** based on `TreeExplainer`. The application provides an intuitive **"Why) Tj
T* (this prediction?"** analytical breakdown that identifies top contributing factors and transparently classifies their) Tj
T* (directional contribution into **"Supports Approval"** or **"Supports Rejection"**.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 294.8033858267715459 Td
(The solution is packaged as a responsive full-stack web application with a **Flask** backend, a validated semantic) Tj
T* (**HTML/CSS/JavaScript** frontend, and a rigorous 10-rule client-and-server input validation engine. The application) Tj
T* (is production-ready, serialized using `joblib`, and configured for cloud deployment on **Render** via **Gunicorn**) Tj
T* (and **Git/GitHub**.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 226.2049606299211746 Td
(*Keywords:* Machine Learning, Bank Loan Approval, Random Forest, Logistic Regression, Explainable AI, SHAP,) Tj
T* (Flask, BCA Project.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8 Tf
9.1999999999999993 TL
