(## CHAPTER 1: INTRODUCTION) Tj
ET
BT
/F10 12 Tf
13.7999999999999989 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 692.2207086614173477 Td
(1.1 Background) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 675.212834645669318 Td
(Credit underwriting constitutes the foundational bedrock of commercial banking and financial intermediation. When) Tj
T* (individuals apply for retail loans—whether for education, home purchase, medical emergency, debt consolidation, or) Tj
T* (entrepreneurial venture—financial institutions must meticulously evaluate creditworthiness to balance profitability) Tj
T* (against insolvency risks.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 606.614409448818833 Td
(Historically, this appraisal process relied heavily on manual documentation verification, subjective interviews, and) Tj
T* (manual credit score evaluations conducted by branch credit officers. While human expertise possesses qualitative) Tj
T* (intuition, manual workflows are intrinsically slow, resource-heavy, and susceptible to cognitive fatigue, human bias,) Tj
T* (and inconsistent standards.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 538.0159842519684616 Td
(With the massive expansion of consumer banking and the democratization of digital financial services, financial) Tj
T* (institutions process thousands of loan applications on a daily basis. To handle this volume without compromising risk) Tj
T* (management standards, machine learning classification algorithms have emerged as powerful tools capable of) Tj
T* (discerning complex non-linear patterns within historical applicant data.) Tj
ET
BT
/F10 12 Tf
13.7999999999999989 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 469.4175590551180335 Td
(1.2 Introduction to LoanGuard AI) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 452.4096850393700038 Td
(**LoanGuard AI** is an AI-powered bank loan approval prediction web system developed as a final-year Bachelor of) Tj
T* (Computer Applications \(BCA\) academic project. The system provides an automated, objective, and explainable) Tj
T* (computational mechanism to assess loan applications.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 397.4175590551180335 Td
(Given 13 structured applicant attributes—spanning personal demographics, employment history, financial earnings,) Tj
T* (requested loan terms, and credit bureau records—LoanGuard AI predicts whether an application is likely to be) Tj
T* (**Approved \(1\)** or **Rejected \(0\)**.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 342.4254330708660063 Td
(Beyond delivering a binary classification outcome, LoanGuard AI addresses one of the most critical deficiencies of) Tj
T* (modern artificial intelligence: **the lack of model explainability**. Utilizing **SHAP \(SHapley Additive) Tj
T* (exPlanations\)**, the system deconstructs each individual prediction into its constituent drivers through a dedicated) Tj
T* (**"Why this prediction?"** module, categorizing each factor as either *supporting approval* or *supporting rejection*.) Tj
ET
BT
/F10 12 Tf
13.7999999999999989 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 273.827007874015635 Td
(1.3 Scope of the Project) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 256.8191338582676053 Td
(The scope of this project encompasses:) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
62.3622047244094517 237.5435433070864519 Td
(1. Cleaning and curating a structured banking dataset of 45,000 historical records.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
62.3622047244094517 219.6852755905509866 Td
(2. Formulating automated preprocessing pipelines including outlier filtering, categorical encoding, and feature) Tj
T* (standardization.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
62.3622047244094517 188.2207086614171203 Td
(3. Training and comparatively evaluating two supervised machine learning models: **Logistic Regression** and) Tj
T* (**Random Forest Classifier**.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
62.3622047244094517 156.7561417322833677 Td
(4. Generating model interpretability at the local instance level using **SHAP TreeExplainer**.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
62.3622047244094517 138.8978740157479024 Td
(5. Constructing a full-stack web application using **Flask** and modern front-end technologies with a strict 10-rule) Tj
T* (validation engine.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
62.3622047244094517 107.4333070866140361 Td
(6. Packaging the project for cloud deployment using **Gunicorn** and **Render**.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8 Tf
9.1999999999999993 TL
0.471 g
489.1470866141731904 34.0157480314960594 Td
(Page 10 of 62) Tj
