56.6929133858267775 720.0002362204724022 Td
(## CHAPTER 2: PROBLEM STATEMENT) Tj
ET
BT
/F10 12 Tf
13.7999999999999989 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 692.2207086614173477 Td
(2.1 The Operational Bottleneck in Traditional Credit Underwriting) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 675.212834645669318 Td
(Retail lending institutions encounter three fundamental challenges in managing consumer loan applications:) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
62.3622047244094517 647.4333070866141497 Td
(1. **Processing Latency and Manual Overhead**:) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 629.5750393700786844 Td
(Traditional underwriting procedures require manual examination of financial records, tax returns, salary stubs, and) Tj
T* (historical credit reports. A single application can take several days or weeks to process, leading to operational backlogs) Tj
T* (and customer attrition.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
62.3622047244094517 574.5829133858267141 Td
(2. **Inconsistency and Human Subjectivity**:) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 556.7246456692913625 Td
(Human loan officers inevitably apply idiosyncratic heuristics. Factors such as unconscious bias, differing risk tolerances) Tj
T* (among branch managers, or fatigue can lead to inconsistent credit decisions on similar financial profiles.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
62.3622047244094517 515.3388188976377933 Td
(3. **High Cost of Default vs. Lost Opportunity**:) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 497.4805511811023848 Td
(Lending involves asymmetric risk: approving a borrower who subsequently defaults \(a False Positive\) causes direct) Tj
T* (capital loss; conversely, rejecting a solvent applicant \(a False Negative\) forfeits interest revenue and damages customer) Tj
T* (goodwill. Traditional rule-based scorecards frequently fail to capture subtle multi-feature interactions.) Tj
ET
BT
/F10 12 Tf
13.7999999999999989 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 442.4884251968504145 Td
(2.2 The "Black-Box" Dilemma in Automated Systems) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
