/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 615.9687401574802834 Td
(Applicants visit a bank branch or fill out extensive paper and PDF application packages. Credit underwriters manually) Tj
T* (examine salary slips, employer verification letters, tax assessments, bank account statements, and external credit bureau) Tj
T* (reports. Decisions are deliberated individually or through credit appraisal committees.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
62.3622047244094517 560.9766141732283131 Td
(2. **Static Rule-Based Scorecard Systems**:) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 543.1183464566929615 Td
(Many legacy systems use rigid, hard-coded scoring matrices. For instance:) Tj
