(\\text{If } \\text{Credit Score} > 700 \\text{ AND } \\text{Income} > \\$50,000 \\text{ AND } \\text{Debt-to-Income} < 0.40 \\rightarrow \\text{Approve, Else Reject}) Tj
ET
