/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
73.7007874015748143 428.5986614173227736 Td
(**Prolonged Turnaround Times**: Manual document verification requires days or weeks, frustrating prospective) Tj
T* (borrowers and limiting loan application throughput.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
62.3622047244094517 397.1340944881889072 Td
(•) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
73.7007874015748143 397.1340944881889072 Td
(**Inability to Learn Multi-Factor Interactions**: Static scorecards operate on independent threshold rules. They) Tj
T* (cannot discover latent correlations—for example, where a slightly lower credit score is safely offset by a) Tj
T* (substantial income, low loan-to-income ratio, and long stable employment history.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
62.3622047244094517 352.063228346456583 Td
(•) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
73.7007874015748143 352.063228346456583 Td
(**Subjective Human Vulnerability**: Different loan officers may evaluate identical borderline cases with) Tj
T* (differing outcomes, introducing institutional inconsistency and compliance vulnerability.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
62.3622047244094517 320.5986614173227736 Td
(•) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
73.7007874015748143 320.5986614173227736 Td
(**High Operational Costs**: Maintaining large manual underwriting departments incurs continuous labor) Tj
T* (expenses, which scales linearly with applicant volume.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
62.3622047244094517 289.1340944881889072 Td
(•) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
73.7007874015748143 289.1340944881889072 Td
(**Lack of Local Explanation in Automated Rules**: Static rules state *which* hard threshold was breached, but) Tj
T* (cannot quantify the relative weight of different financial factors in borderline cases.) Tj
ET
