(The proposed system, **LoanGuard AI**, replaces slow manual appraisal and rigid static rulebooks with an intelligent,) Tj
T* (data-driven, and transparent computational architecture. LoanGuard AI combines the predictive strength of ensemble) Tj
T* (machine learning \(**Random Forest Classifier**\) with the transparency of cooperative game-theoretic interpretability) Tj
T* (\(**SHAP**\), delivered through a lightweight **Flask** web application.) Tj
ET
