(1. **High Predictive Generalization**:) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 563.2443307086614368 Td
(Trained on 35,992 historical bank loan records, the Random Forest model captures intricate non-linear relationships) Tj
T* (across 13 diverse attributes, achieving an **Accuracy of 92.58%** and an **ROC-AUC of 0.9742** on the held-out) Tj
T* (test dataset.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
62.3622047244094517 508.2522047244094097 Td
(2. **Balanced Handling of Class Imbalance**:) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 490.3939370078740012 Td
(By incorporating cost-sensitive class weighting \(`class_weight='balanced'`\), the system compensates for the natural) Tj
T* (imbalance in lending data \(where rejections outnumber approvals roughly 3.5 to 1\), achieving a high **Recall of) Tj
T* (85.75%** on approved loans.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
62.3622047244094517 435.4018110236220309 Td
(3. **Instance-Level Explainable AI \(SHAP\)**:) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 417.5435433070865656 Td
(For every loan application submitted, the system automatically runs `shap.TreeExplainer` to isolate the primary factors) Tj
T* (driving the prediction. It clearly displays:) Tj
