(Every technical component in LoanGuard AI was deliberately selected to fulfill specific functional, algorithmic, and) Tj
T* (architectural requirements. Below is a rigorous examination of each technology detailing: \(1\) what it is, \(2\) why it was) Tj
T* (selected, and \(3\) how it was applied in this project.) Tj
