(1. **What it is**: A high-level, interpreted, general-purpose programming language renowned for its dynamic) Tj
T* (typing, extensive standard library, and preeminent machine learning ecosystem.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
62.3622047244094517 571.7482677165354517 Td
(2. **Why it is used**: Python is the global industry standard for data science and machine learning. Its clean syntax) Tj
T* (enables rapid prototyping, and its ecosystem contains interoperable packages for data manipulation, statistical) Tj
T* (modeling, and web backend development.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
62.3622047244094517 526.6774015748030706 Td
(3. **How it is used in this project**: Python serves as the foundational programming language for the entire backend) Tj
T* (system—driving data ingestion, preprocessing, model training, evaluation, SHAP explanation calculations, and Flask) Tj
T* (server endpoints.) Tj
ET
BT
/F10 12 Tf
13.7999999999999989 TL
