/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
62.3622047244094517 439.086850393700729 Td
(1. **What it is**: An open-source Python library implementing a comprehensive suite of machine learning,) Tj
T* (preprocessing, cross-validation, and evaluation algorithms built atop NumPy and SciPy.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
62.3622047244094517 407.6222834645669195 Td
(2. **Why it is used**: It provides standardized, battle-tested, and computationally optimized implementations of) Tj
T* (classifiers, scalers, encoders, and metric evaluators with consistent `fit` and `transform` interfaces.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
62.3622047244094517 376.1577165354330532 Td
(3. **How it is used in this project**: Used to execute the 80/20 stratified train-test split \(`train_test_split`\), apply) Tj
T* (numerical standardization \(`StandardScaler`\), perform categorical encoding \(`OneHotEncoder`\), train) Tj
T* (`LogisticRegression` and `RandomForestClassifier`, and calculate performance metrics \(`accuracy_score`,) Tj
T* (`precision_score`, `recall_score`, `f1_score`, `roc_auc_score`, `confusion_matrix`, `classification_report`\).) Tj
