/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
62.3622047244094517 243.4962992125985011 Td
(2. **Why it is used**: It naturally captures complex non-linear feature interactions, resists overfitting through) Tj
T* (bootstrap aggregating \(bagging\) and random subspace feature selection, and supports cost-sensitive class balancing) Tj
T* (\(`class_weight="balanced"`\).) Tj
ET
