/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
62.3622047244094517 198.42543307086612 Td
(3. **How it is used in this project**: Selected as the final production model for LoanGuard AI. Configured with 200) Tj
T* (estimators \(`n_estimators=200`\), balanced class weights, and multi-threading \(`n_jobs=-1`\), achieving 92.58%) Tj
T* (accuracy on the test set.) Tj
