(The model is trained on a static historical dataset of 44,990 cleaned observations. While comprehensive, the dataset may) Tj
T* (not capture broader economic variables such as regional inflation, shifting central bank interest rates, local employment) Tj
T* (market variations, or emerging financial instruments.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
