ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 560.1262204724409912 Td
(The preprocessing pipeline removed 10 records based on hard boundaries \($        ext{age} le 80$, $        ext{emp_exp} le 60$\).) Tj
T* (While this removed clear data entry anomalies, applying static heuristic cutoffs in production requires ongoing review) Tj
T* (to ensure valid edge-case applicants are not excluded.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
62.3622047244094517 505.1340944881889641 Td
(3. **Interpretability vs. True Causality**:) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 487.2758267716535556 Td
(SHAP values quantify internal feature contributions within the trained Random Forest model; they do not establish) Tj
T* (real-world causal relationships. An attribution indicating that an interest rate "Supports Rejection" simply reflects) Tj
T* (historical correlations in the training data, not a direct economic cause of credit insolvency.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
62.3622047244094517 432.2837007874015853 Td
(4. **Synthetic and Historical Constraints**:) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.118 g
56.6929133858267775 414.42543307086612 Td
(The dataset does not reflect real-time credit bureau inquiries, live open-banking API transaction feeds, or dynamic) Tj
T* (behavioral telemetry, which modern fintech underwriters incorporate into lending decisions.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.157 g
62.3622047244094517 373.0396062992126076 Td
